    ("q-ai-nn-027", "c-ai-nn-004", "Repeat", "What are the core internal gates of a standard Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) cell?", ["Forget gate", "Input gate", "Attention gate", "Output gate", "Pooling gate"], [0, 1, 3], "An LSTM cell uses a Forget gate, an Input gate, and an Output gate to regulate information flow. Attention and pooling are not standard LSTM gates.", -1.3, 0.9),
